---
import AppLayout from '../layouts/AppLayout.astro';
---
<AppLayout title="About NearSpot">
  <main class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 py-12">
    <h1 class="text-3xl font-bold text-navy mb-4">About NearSpot</h1>
    <p class="text-gray-600 mb-6">
      NearSpot is a hyperlocal shopping platform connecting customers with nearby stores,
      services, and vendors in their neighbourhood. Discover what's available around you,
      reserve products, and support local businesses.
    </p>

    <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-navy mb-3">Our Mission</h2>
    <p class="text-gray-600 mb-6">
      We believe in empowering local commerce. Our goal is to make it effortless for
      customers to find, explore, and transact with neighbourhood vendors — and for
      vendors to reach customers who are just around the corner.
    </p>

    <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-navy mb-3">Key Features</h2>
    <ul class="list-disc pl-5 text-gray-600 space-y-2 mb-6">
      <li>Discover stores and services near your location</li>
      <li>Browse products, check availability, and make reservations</li>
      <li>Chat directly with vendors</li>
      <li>Earn and redeem loyalty points on every purchase</li>
      <li>Vendor dashboard with analytics, inventory, and more</li>
    </ul>

    <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-navy mb-3">Contact Us</h2>
    <p class="text-gray-600">
      Have questions or feedback? Reach out to us at
      <a href="mailto:support@nearspot.in" class="text-navy underline">support@nearspot.in</a>.
    </p>
  </main>
</AppLayout>
